# Keep credentials, run archives, model caches and the rest of the project out
# of the Render build context. Only dashboard definitions and public config ship.
**
!observability/
!observability/render/
!observability/render/**
!observability/grafana/
!observability/grafana/dashboards/
!observability/grafana/dashboards/history/
!observability/grafana/dashboards/history/*.json
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.tgz
